<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on CITIC Pacific.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on CITIC Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Monday it has launched 105 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$37.43	 PREMIUM	 16.22 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.836	 GEARING	 4.71x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   24.APR.98	PAYDATE	 12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  14.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$39.40	 EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
